--- !u!114 &114035885878943294
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1172508692542786}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 761
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 另外，门派每三十年会举办一次{color=#d0380a}宗门大比{/color}，夺魁者不仅可以直接成为内门弟子，拜入我派任一一位长老门下修习，还能获得一枚{color=#d0380a}筑基丹{/color}作为奖励。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 517
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114199620201542881
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1172508692542786}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 731
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 这些下等魔短期内虽然不足为虑，但若是放任不管，也会带来不少祸端。因此，宁州修士们约定俗成，每隔二十年会打开一次天魔眼外的禁制，令修为相当的门派弟子及散修前去清缴。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114836781107948048}
  AvatarIntID: 622
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114913982430673841
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1172508692542786}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 402
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 没想到此行竟如此凶险，还好{shidi}你能平安归来。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114836781107948048}
  AvatarIntID: 417
