  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 729
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 灵脉遭到污染，附近的妖兽与人类也被魔气侵蚀魔化，当时的几大修真门派付出了很大的代价，才将这处魔地封印起来，阻止了魔气的进一步扩散。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114836781107948048}
  AvatarIntID: 622
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114452566635765133
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1172508692542786}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 631
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 结丹之时，压缩的灵气越多，最终成丹的品质也越高。高品阶的金丹不但能够改善体质，还可以提升修炼速度，甚至改变灵根。
